{"at":"2026-07-16T01:18:58Z","commit_ref":"774b151","decision":"include","gate":"build","rationale":"Spec §0 Gate explicitly requires green `dotnet build Berreman.slnx -c Release`. The new MuellerReconstruction Domain module (Part A.1), the Storage CSV parser/file-backed factory (Part C), and the BerremanTests deliverable all live under Berreman/**/*.fs, matching this gate's applies_to; filter=none so no select list."}
{"at":"2026-07-16T01:18:58Z","commit_ref":"774b151","decision":"include","gate":"unit-tests","rationale":"Spec §0 Deliverable + Gate name the UI-less tests in Berreman/BerremanTests and require green `dotnet test` there (Part E composition root + the round-trip/transpose-guard pure tests in Part A). That project is this gate's primary applies_to (Berreman/BerremanTests/**); filter=none."}
{"at":"2026-07-16T01:18:58Z","commit_ref":"774b151","decision":"include","gate":"constructor-unit-tests","rationale":"Parts A.1/B/C add net-new production code to OpticalConstructor.Domain (MuellerReconstruction, Retardance, MuellerDataProxy, MuellerSolverProxy) and OpticalConstructor.Storage (createFileBacked factory + BOM-tolerant CSV parser), with mock-driven seam + parser tests alongside ExperimentDataProxyTests in OpticalConstructor.Tests. All fall under this gate's applies_to Berreman/OpticalConstructor/**; filter=none."}
{"at":"2026-07-16T01:18:58Z","commit_ref":"774b151","decision":"exclude","gate":"ui-smoke","rationale":"Spec is explicitly UI-less (title + §0 mandate; no Avalonia type, no view/panel/App change). This gate's applies_to is scoped to OpticalConstructor.Ui/**, OpticalConstructor.Ui.Tests/**, OpticalConstructor.App/** — none of which this spec changes, so the FuncUI render/host smoke surface is untouched. Any transitive compile breakage is already caught by the included build gate."}
{"at":"2026-07-16T01:18:58Z","commit_ref":"774b151","decision":"exclude","gate":"ui-tests","rationale":"Same basis as ui-smoke: the spec adds no OpticalConstructor.Ui/OpticalConstructor.Ui.Tests/OpticalConstructor.App files, so this per-panel FuncUI view-test gate's applies_to matches nothing in scope. The spec adds only new Domain types and reuses existing view-facing signatures unchanged, so no rendered view can regress; build covers the transitive compile."}
